/-!
# A quasi-coherent algebra is a directed colimit of quasi-coherent algebras of finite presentation

Let `X` be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated scheme and `𝒜` a quasi-coherent sheaf of
commutative `𝒪_X`-algebras. Then `𝒜` is the colimit of a directed system of quasi-coherent
`𝒪_X`-algebras of finite presentation. This is [Stacks, Tag 05JS].

## Main results

* `Stacks.QcohAlgebraFPColimit.exists_directedSystem_of_isFinitePresentation`: a quasi-coherent
  algebra on a quasi-compact quasi-separated scheme is the colimit of a directed system of
  quasi-coherent algebras of finite presentation.

## Implementation notes

The system is `Stacks.SymQuotientSystem.system`: its index is the set of pairs `(i, ℐ)` with `i`
a stage of the system of finitely presented quasi-coherent modules presenting the underlying
module of `𝒜` ([Stacks, Tag 01PK], read on sections) and `ℐ` a finite type quasi-coherent sheaf
of ideals on the vector bundle `𝐕(ℱᵢ)` killed by the projection `Spec_X(𝒜) ⟶ 𝐕(ℱᵢ)`, and its
member at `(i, ℐ)` is `Sym(ℱᵢ)/ℐ`.

**Why free stages cannot be used.** A morphism of algebra sheaves out of
`Stacks.FPAlgebraSheaf.polynomialAlgebra X n` is, by the relative-spectrum adjunction, `n`
*global* sections of the target, so a system of polynomial quotients reaches only the subalgebra
generated by restrictions of global sections; on `ℙ¹` with `𝒜 = Sym(𝒪(-1))` that is the
constants, while `𝒜(U₀) = k[t][y]` has a generator in degree one. The stages therefore have to
be quotients of the symmetric algebra of a non-free finitely presented module, which is what the
index above provides.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 05JS](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/05JS)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 01PK](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01PK)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits Opposite TopologicalSpace AlgebraicGeometry
open Stacks.AffineAlgebraEquivalence Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.FiniteTypeDominating
open Stacks.SymQuotientSystem

universe u

namespace Stacks.QcohAlgebraFPColimit

/-- Let `X` be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated scheme and let `𝒜` be a quasi-coherent sheaf of
commutative `𝒪_X`-algebras. Then there are a directed set `I`, a system `(𝒜ᵢ, φᵢᵢ')` over `I` of
`𝒪_X`-algebras and morphisms `φᵢ : 𝒜ᵢ ⟶ 𝒜` with each `𝒜ᵢ` quasi-coherent of finite
presentation, such that the `φᵢ` induce an isomorphism `colim 𝒜ᵢ ≅ 𝒜`. -/
@[stacks 05JS]
theorem exists_directedSystem_of_isFinitePresentation (X : Scheme.{u}) [CompactSpace ↥X]
    [QuasiSeparatedSpace ↥X] (A : X.QuasicoherentAlgebra)
    (hA : Scheme.QuasicoherentAlgebra.IsQuasicoherent A) :
    ∃ (I : Type (u + 1)) (_ : PartialOrder I) (_ : Nonempty I) (_ : IsDirected I (· ≤ ·))
      (F : Functor I X.QuasicoherentAlgebra) (φ : F ⟶ (Functor.const I).obj A),
      (∀ i, Scheme.QuasicoherentAlgebra.IsQuasicoherent (F.obj i) ∧
        Scheme.QuasicoherentAlgebra.IsOfFinitePresentation (F.obj i)) ∧
        Nonempty (IsColimit (Cocone.mk A φ)) := by
  have hAqc : Stacks.RelativeSpec.AlgebraSheaf.IsQuasicoherent A := hA
  have hAmod : (Scheme.QuasicoherentAlgebra.underlyingModule A).IsQuasicoherent := hA
  obtain ⟨I, _, _, _, D, φ, hfp, -, hsurj, hinj⟩ :=
    Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ModuleLimits.exists_directed_system_sections X
      (Scheme.QuasicoherentAlgebra.underlyingModule A)
  have hDfp : ∀ i, (D.obj i).IsFinitePresentation := hfp
  have hDqc : ∀ i, (D.obj i).IsQuasicoherent :=
    fun i => _root_.isQuasicoherent_of_isFinitePresentation _
  refine @exists_directedSystem_of_affineSections_of_smallIndex X A (Index (proj A φ))
    (indexPartialOrder (proj A φ)) (indexNonempty (proj A φ))
    (indexIsDirected (proj A φ) (fun _ _ h => proj_comp A φ h))
    (system (proj A φ))
    (cocone (proj A φ) A (relativeSpecOverIso A) (fun _ _ h => proj_comp A φ h))
    (fun a => isQuasicoherent_system_obj (proj A φ) a)
    (fun a => isOfFinitePresentation_system_obj (proj A φ) a)
    (fun U hU x => ?_) (fun U hU a x y h => ?_)
  · obtain ⟨i, t, ht⟩ := hsurj U hU.isCompact x
    refine exists_section_of_section A φ U x i t ?_
    exact (Stacks.SymAlgSheaf.algebraLift_ungradedIncl_gen A (D.obj i) (φ.app i) (op U) t).trans ht
  · exact exists_map_eq_of_coconeApp_eq A φ U hU a x y h

end Stacks.QcohAlgebraFPColimit

end
